00:46:11.556 --> 00:46:14.007
That, that's why this was- Yeah,
yeah … really neat to hear about

00:46:14.007 --> 00:46:18.216
these different sort of… It's like a
framework or a strategy for implementing

00:46:18.217 --> 00:46:19.900
this, and it was really, really cool.

00:46:21.004 --> 00:46:24.408
Yeah, because, well, in my
experience at least, we often get

